) / Kaguya Wants to Forgive (Ice)","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17477","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"17477","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[402]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"354198","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"70355","synopsis":"Kaguya has frozen her heart as a result of the trial in her brain. Shirogane was unable to hide his turmoil as the Kaguya who stood before him had radically changed from the day before. Shirogane tries to talk to Kaguya to solve the situation. But she runs away, and a chase within the school suddenly begins. Finally, as Shirogane catches up, he shares his thoughts.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9706324/screencap/6428ddd220372.jpg"},{"title":"Kaguya Wants to Eat It (Ice) / Our Persona / Kaguya Wants to Confess (Ice)","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17477","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"17477","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[403]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"354198","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"70356","synopsis":"After she saw Shirogane's bento lunch box during the lunch break, Kaguya tried to tempt him indirectly for a single bite. He noticed her actions, but due to a certain happening, the distance between the two rapidly closed. However, Kaguya's daring actions cause Shirogane to lose consciousness. While staring at Shirogane asleep in bed, inside Kaguya's head, she is...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9707594/screencap/642a15a8b6dce.jpg"},{"title":"Kaguya Is Fine with It","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17477","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"17477","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[404]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"354198","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"70357","synopsis":"Christmas Eve. Friends and lovers. Everyone spends time in their own way. Shirogane and Kaguya, who joined the Fujiwara Family's Christmas party, enjoyed the Fujiwara Family's brand of hospitality. As the fun time passed quickly, they found themselves on the way home. The two, who cannot express their honest feelings, sit side-by-side on a park bench.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9707596/screencap/642a16612657b.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":151384,"malId":52198},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-29T07:54:59Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:151384","mal:52198"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15807","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"17477","scope":"O","ranges":{"1-4":"1-4","1|4":"1-4"}},{"provider":"anidb","id":"17477","scope":"R","ranges":{"1":"1","1-4|-4":"1","1-4":"1|4","1|4":"1|4"}},{"provider":"anidb","id":"17477","scope":"S","ranges":{"1-4":"401-404","1|4":"401-404"}},{"provider":"anidb","id":"19402","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"19402","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"125368"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"151384","ranges":{"1":"1-4|-4","1|4":"1-4"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165557"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"194884"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt21599874"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt23770418","ranges":{"1":"1","1-4|-4":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"43609"},{"provider":"mal","id":"50325"},{"provider":"mal","id":"52198","ranges":{"1-4|-4":"1","1-4":"1|4"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"61903"},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"997317","ranges":{"1":"1","1-4|-4":"1","1-4":"1|4","1|4":"1|4"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"83121","scope":"s0"},{"provider":"tvdb_movie","id":"338257","ranges":{"1":"1","1-4|-4":"1"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"354198","scope":"s0","ranges":{"1":"5-8|-4","1-4|-4":"9","1-4":"5-8","1|4":"5-8"}}]},"sourceMetadata":{"info":{"id":4583,"title":"Kaguya-sam